  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Biodiversity and Ecosystem-Bases Adaptation to Climate Change in Wadi Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to protect the rapidly deteriorating natural resources in Wadi Gaza, improve the livelihoods of the residents of the Gaza Strip, as well as strengthen the institutional capacity of the Joint Service Council of Wadi Gaza and the neighbouring municipalities. The proposed initiative will also create nature-based solutions to mitigate the flood risks and enhance the biodiversity at the Wadi, as well as provide green and safe public areas and utilities for Gaza residents, especially</narrative>
  </description>
